Let $ABCD$ be a square. Points $P,Q,R,S$ lie on sides $AB,BC,CD,DA$, respectively, and the lines $PR$ and $BC$ are parallel, as are the lines $SQ$ and $AB$. Let $Z$ be the intersection of $PR$ and $SQ$. Given $BP=7$, $BQ=6$, and $DZ=5$, find the side length of square $ABCD$. Here $XY$ denotes the length of segment $XY$.

[asy]
import geometry;
settings.tex="none";
defaultpen(black+linewidth(0.65));
size(225);
pair A=(0,10),B=(0,0),C=(10,0),D=(10,10),P=(0,7),Q=(6,0),R=(10,7),S=(6,10),Z=(6,7);
draw(A--B--C--D--cycle);draw(P--R);draw(Q--S);draw(Z--D);
label("A",A,(-1,1));label("B",B,(-1,-1));label("C",C,(1,-1));label("D",D,(1,1));
label("P",P,(-1,0));label("Q",Q,(0,-1));label("R",R,(1,0));label("S",S,(0,1));label("Z",Z,(-1,-1));
[/asy]

As shown in the figure, $A,B,C,D$ lie on a circle in this order. The angle between the tangent at $B$ and line $AB$ is $30^\circ$, and the angle between the tangent at $C$ and line $CD$ is $10^\circ$. Lines $AB$ and $DC$ are parallel and lie on opposite sides of the center of the circle. Find $\angle BDC$.

[asy]
import geometry;
settings.tex="none";
defaultpen(black+linewidth(0.65));
size(250);
pair A=dir(150),B=dir(210),C=dir(-10),D=dir(10);
draw(unitcircle);draw(A--B);draw(D--C);
draw((B-0.55*dir(120))--(B+0.55*dir(120)));draw((C-0.65*dir(80))--(C+0.65*dir(80)));
draw(arc(B,0.26,90,120));draw(arc(C,0.26,80,90));
label("30",B+0.38*dir(98),(1,0));label("10",C+0.38*dir(85),(-1,0));
label("A",A,(-1,1));label("B",B,(-1,-1));label("C",C,(1,-1));label("D",D,(1,1));
[/asy]

A cube $ABCD$-$EFGH$ of side length $2012$ and a plane are situated in space so that their intersection is a hexagon $IJKLMN$. The points $I,J,K,L,M,N$ lie on edges $AE,EF,FG,GC,CD,DA$, respectively. Given
$$AI-GL=8,\qquad CM-EJ=6,\qquad FK-DN=4,$$
find the area of hexagon $IJKLMN$ minus the sum of the areas of triangles $IKM$ and $JLN$. Here $XY$ denotes the length of segment $XY$.

[asy]
import geometry;
settings.tex="none";
defaultpen(black+linewidth(0.65));
size(325);
pair A=(0,3),B=(3,3),C=(4,4),D=(1,4),E=(0,0),F=(3,0),G=(4,1),H=(1,1);
pair I=(0,1.5),J=(1.4,0),K=(3.5,0.5),L=(4,2.5),M=(2.4,4),N=(0.45,3.45);
draw(E--H--G,dotted);draw(H--D,dotted);
draw(A--B--C--D--cycle);draw(A--E--F--B);draw(F--G--C);
draw(I--J);draw(J--K,dotted);draw(K--L);draw(L--M,dotted);draw(M--N);draw(N--I,dotted);
label("A",A,(-1,1));label("B",B,(-1,1));label("C",C,(1,1));label("D",D,(-1,1));
label("E",E,(-1,-1));label("F",F,(1,-1));label("G",G,(1,-1));label("H",H,(-1,1));
label("I",I,(-1,0));label("J",J,(0,-1));label("K",K,(1,0));label("L",L,(1,0));label("M",M,(0,1));label("N",N,(-1,1));
[/asy]
